<node>
    <node name="description" channel="inline" format="text/plain" model="Adds the operand to the result. CAUTION! Do NOT use the "add" operation for characters! They may be concatenated by using the "modify/append" or "modify/overwrite" operation. CAUTION! There are several ways to use addition, with unary or binary operators. This function works like an UNARY operator. The "result" parametre represents the FIRST operand; the "operand" parametre the SECOND."/>
